# Normalize all text files in this tree to LF (both in the index and the worktree).
#
# Why this exists: several gates in this repository are byte-level rather than
# semantic -- `verify-anchors.mjs` matches probe `from` snippets (written with
# explicit "\n" escapes) against source read as UTF-8, coverage offsets and
# package blob hashes are compared across hosts, and the guard-probe table is
# parsed by anchoring on "\n]\n". If a Windows checkout turns those files into
# CRLF, every one of those comparisons silently stops matching and the failures
# look like anchor rot rather than a line-ending problem.
#
# Declaring `eol=lf` keeps every host looking at the same bytes.
* text=auto eol=lf
